@startuml Matchday Penalty Shootout Use Cases
title Matchday V5 - Casos de uso de tanda de penales

left to right direction
actor Operador

usecase "Iniciar tanda" as Start
usecase "Registrar lanzamiento" as Kick
usecase "Reducir participantes" as Reduce
usecase "Finalizar tanda" as Finish

Operador --> Start
Operador --> Kick
Operador --> Reduce
Operador --> Finish
Kick ..> Start : tanda activa
Reduce ..> Start : igualdad numérica
Finish ..> Kick : ganador decidido
@enduml
